<Base title="Privacy Policy"><div class="interior"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1></div><article class="reading"><section><h2>This proof of concept</h2><p>The preview does not accept service requests. The disabled form does not collect or submit data. No separate analytics service, advertising pixel, lead tracker, or site cookie is installed.</p></section><section><h2>Hosting and sheet requests</h2><p>GitHub Pages may process technical request information to serve this site. The sheet-backed version requests public business information from Google Sheets; Google may process network information needed to deliver that response. This site does not add personal form data to those requests.</p></section><section><h2>External links</h2><p>Official business sites, research links, and photo credits are separate websites with their own privacy practices. Review their policies before sharing information there. A production version needs a privacy review that reflects its actual tools and contact handling.</p></section></article></Base>
